From f161510e08c00a1cf40a5ac1d59ddfb9ddd671bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kelvenhighermind <kelven@highermind.com.br>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:23:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Unlock all features for self-hosted fork; configure learnflow
 deployment

Remove the paid license gate (unlimited accounts, shared mailboxes,
forwarding, branding) and stop calling the Paymug license API.
Add the D1 database id and mail.learnflow.com.br custom domain.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
